WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760
Narrator: When you're told to open your exit gate: check the other side is clear and safe.

2
00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:10.630
Narrator: Open it fully and secure it open, the way you were shown at your briefing.

3
00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:16.000
Narrator: Stand to the side, where fans can see you - never in the doorway.

4
00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:24.800
Narrator: Keep the gate clear, and politely tell anyone trying to come in that it's exit only - words only, never physical.

5
00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:31.600
Narrator: If an exit is locked, blocked or won't open, report it at once - and send people to the nearest other exit.
